.DS_Store
# The shared agent guards are tracked; everything else here is per-machine. A trailing
# slash would stop git descending, so the exceptions below would never be seen.
.claude/*
!.claude/hooks/
!.claude/settings.json
# Records that a review ran against one exact commit on ONE machine. Sharing it would let
# the gate read someone else's approval as if it were this machine's.
.claude/pr-gate/
# What a proof writes for itself on each run (the plate pane's kept states, read by the words
# check). The proof deletes it before every run, so it never holds anything worth keeping.
tmp/
